      id: 'm5-q-01', module: 'm5', topic: 'm5-conflict-basics', type: 'decide', level: 1,
      q: `<p>A hostel warden says, "My job in any conflict is to make sure nobody ever disagrees." Which option matches the course's definition of conflict management?</p>`,
