      q: `<p>The slide picture of the grid gives each mode a typical line. Place each speaker on the grid and explain using the two dimensions: (a) Ravi: "Uh, can we talk about this some other time?" (b) Neha: "I reckon we can both get what we need." (c) Sam: "Only one can win... and it had better be me!" (d) Leela: "OK, OK, let's just do it your way."</p>`,
