      q: `<p>Your lab report is due in two hours. Two members disagree on which of their graphs goes in the results; both graphs are acceptable. Which style fits best?</p>`,
      options: [`Collaborating, because it is always the best style`, `Avoiding: submit without the results section`, `Compromising: use one graph for the main result and the other in the appendix, since there is a time crunch`, `Competing: the loudest member decides`],
