      answer: `<p><b>Compromising.</b> A time crunch, and a solution simply needs to happen.</p>`,
      explain: `<p>With two hours left and both options acceptable, a quick middle ground fits. Full collaboration takes too long here; avoiding misses the deadline; competing by volume leaves resentment and ignores the other member's view.</p>`,
